OL,3,GNEWSA'I raised thousands for my school
OL,4,Afriend with cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was always questioning myself, like
OL,7,F'what is your why?', and Ollie
OL,8,Fdefinitely kept popping up in my mind
OL,9,Fand made me realise what I was doing."
OL,11,FIn the past year, Hugo Turpin, from
OL,12,FOxfordshire, has completed a marathon,
OL,13,Fultramarathon and climbed Mount
OL,14,FKilimanjaro, all inspired by a
OL,15,Fchildhood friend who lost his leg to a
OL,16,Frare form of cancer.
OL,18,FOlly Foster was first diagnosed at the
OL,19,Fage of 10 with synovial sarcoma, a rare
OL,20,Fform of soft tissue cancer, and was
OL,21,Fsupported by the charity Sarcoma UK.
