OL,4,Afriend with cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a re-diagnosis in 2025, the
OL,7,Fthen 18-year-old was forced to undergo
OL,8,Ftwo rounds of intensive chemotherapy,
OL,9,Ffollowed by a a below-knee amputation.
